BBUUGGSS
     The bbssddiiffff utility does not store the hashes of _o_l_d_f_i_l_e or _n_e_w_f_i_l_e in
     _p_a_t_c_h_f_i_l_e.  As a result, it is possible to apply a patch to the wrong
     file; this will usually produce garbage.  It is recommended that users of
     bbssddiiffff store the hashes of _o_l_d_f_i_l_e and _n_e_w_f_i_l_e and compare against them
